  "description": "Request for air-conditioning condenser unit to be placed on roof. The air-conditioning is only for use on days in the summer months when the internal temperature in the bedrooms reaches intolerable levels and therefore impairs sleep quality.  The condenser unit will be placed to the rear centre of the roof, away from neighbouring properties on both sides, and to ensure it is not visible from the street. The proposed unit is a new high quality unit with a quiet night setting. It has a max sound level equivalent to normal conversation and so will not cause any disruption to our neighbours. It will be used at a minimum level to cool bedrooms only during hot spells in the summer.",
